":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.0, 4.6.1dev and latest 456bdea954ee24e48cb562bfbf531de1cd96e371\n\n### System information\n\nWindows11\n\n### Issue description\n\n### Bug description\nWhen using 2D skeleton animation, I mirror-flip the character via Node2D scale to play the opposite-direction animation. However, SkeletonModification2DJiggle does not handle Node2D mirroring correctly: the jiggle bones still point to the pre-mirror direction. The issue appears to come from look_at being calculated purely from global positions, ignoring mirrored transforms.\n\nAdditionally, during sudden changes like mirror flip or teleport, the jiggle simulation becomes numerically unstable for a moment. A manual reset API would allow developers to reset the jiggle cache when needed, without changing default behavior.\n\n\n### Expected behavior\nAfter mirroring, jiggle bones should correctly orient toward the target in the mirrored space.\n\n### Actual behavior\nJiggle bones keep pointing toward the pre-mirror direction.\n\n### Screenshots\nBefore mirror:\n<img width=\"557\" height=\"453\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58a8e073-6d7c-4325-9c70-c63c8038e177\" />\n\n\nAfter mirror (bug):\n<img width=\"519\" height=\"461\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b4b74b2-dfad-4f36-89ec-91ebf04b67ff\" />\n\nExpected:\n<img width=\"571\" height=\"462\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f97a584f-e66e-4913-a2bc-e3f209371e77\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a 2D character with Skeleton2D/Bone2D and add a SkeletonModification2DJiggle to a bone chain.\n2. Mirror the character by setting the parent Node2D scale to (-1, 1) (or any negative scale).\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test2dskeleton.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26108260/test2dskeleton.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117610/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}